exports[`node practice .npmrc — expo hoisted linker given: [case3] an expo repo whose lockfile holds two versions of a package when: [t0] the first apply flips the linker to hoisted then: the notice and the .npmrc match snapshot: hoist flip notice 1`] = `
"🟡 node-linker=hoisted added — one copy of each package now wins the root slot
   ├─ packages with more than one version in your graph
   │  ├─ @commitlint/cli  17.8.1, 19.5.0
   │  └─ type-fns         0.8.1, 1.21.3
   │
   └─ remedy
      ├─ any package above may now load a different copy at runtime
      ├─ pin the copy you want via \`pnpm.overrides\` in package.json, then \`pnpm install\`
      └─ see howto.pnpm-expo-hoisted-linker.md (declapract-typescript-ehmpathy)
"
`;
